==Metric categories==

This infobox is designed for economies that prioritize alternative measures of success over traditional GDP-based metrics. It organizes data into six categories:

===Doughnut Economics===
Based on [[Kate Raworth|Raworth's]] framework, measuring whether the economy operates within a "safe and just space" between social foundations and ecological ceilings.

{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| social_foundation_score || Composite score of social foundation || 0–100 scale
|-
| healthcare_access || % with universal healthcare coverage || Percentage
|-
| education_access || Literacy and education rates || Percentage or description
|-
| housing_adequacy || % in adequate, affordable housing || Percentage
|-
| food_security || Food security index score || Score/rank
|-
| income_security || % above poverty line || Percentage
|-
| social_equity || Gini coefficient or inequality measure || Gini value (0–1)
|-
| democratic_participation || Civic engagement metrics || Percentage or description
|-
| ecological_ceiling_score || Composite score of ecological ceiling || 0–100 scale
|-
| carbon_intensity || CO₂ emissions per capita || Tonnes per capita
|-
| resource_footprint || Ecological footprint per capita || Global hectares per capita
|-
| biodiversity_index || Species protection and habitat integrity || 0–1 scale
|-
| air_quality || Average Air Quality Index || AQI value
|-
| water_sustainability || % from renewable sources || Percentage
|-
| land_use_sustainability || % sustainable land management || Percentage
|}

===Circular Economy===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| circularity_rate || % of materials in closed loops || Percentage
|-
| resource_recovery || % of materials recovered from waste || Percentage
|-
| material_productivity || GDP per kg of materials || $/kg
|-
| waste_per_capita || Annual kg per person || kg/year
|-
| recycling_rate || % of municipal waste recycled || Percentage
|-
| product_longevity_index || Average product lifespan || Years
|}

===Happiness & Wellbeing===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| happiness_index || Composite wellbeing score || 0–10 scale
|-
| life_satisfaction || Self-reported life satisfaction || 0–10 scale
|-
| work_life_balance || Work-life balance score || 0–10 scale
|-
| community_cohesion || Social trust levels || Percentage
|-
| mental_wellbeing || Psychological flourishing rate || Percentage
|-
| purpose_index || % reporting meaningful work/life || Percentage
|}

===Mutualism===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| cooperative_employment || % of workers in cooperatives || Percentage
|-
| worker_ownership || % of enterprises worker-owned || Percentage
|-
| social_ownership || % of economy publicly/cooperatively owned || Percentage
|-
| economic_democracy_index || Degree of democratic economic control || 0–1 scale
|-
| cooperative_gdp_share || % of GDP from cooperatives || Percentage
|-
| wealth_distribution || Gini or wage ratio || Gini or ratio (e.g., "5:1 max")
|}

===Post-Growth===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| gdp_growth || Annual GDP growth rate || Percentage (may be low/negative)
|-
| resource_productivity_growth || Change in output per resource unit || Percentage change
|-
| wellbeing_per_gdp || Wellbeing achieved per economic unit || Multiplier (e.g., "2.3x")
|-
| degrowth_trajectory || Planned reduction in throughput || Description
|-
| steady_state_indicator || Proximity to steady-state economy || 0–1 scale
|}

===Post-Work===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| avg_workweek || Average hours worked per week || Hours
|-
| leisure_hours || Free time per week || Hours/week
|-
| automation_rate || Robots per 10,000 workers || Number
|-
| labor_participation || % of population employed || Percentage (may be low by design)
|-
| job_satisfaction || % satisfied with work || Percentage
|-
| universal_basic_services || Number of guaranteed services || Count
|}

===Traditional Metrics===
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Description !! Suggested format
|-
| gdp_ppp || GDP (purchasing power parity) || Value with rank
|-
| gdp_nominal || GDP (nominal) || Value with rank
|-
| gdp_per_capita_ppp || GDP per capita (PPP) || Value
|-
| gdp_per_capita_nominal || GDP per capita (nominal) || Value
|-
| unemployment || Unemployment rate || Percentage
|-
| inflation || Inflation rate || Percentage
|-
| hdi || Human Development Index || 0–1 scale
|-
| ihdi || Inequality-adjusted HDI || 0–1 scale
|}

